    list: [
      'Full name.',
      'Home address or other physical address, including street name and city or town.',
      'Email address.',
      'Mobile number.',
      'Personal identification number.',
      'Any other identifier that permits physical or online contact with a specific individual.',
      'Information about a User that the website collects online from that User and maintains in personally identifiable form, combined with an identifier described in this Privacy Policy.',
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'Cookies and how Archway Business Brokers uses them',
    paragraphs: [
      'A “cookie” is a small data file that may be placed on your device when you visit certain websites. Archway Business Brokers may use cookies to collect, store and sometimes track information for the purposes described in this document and for statistical purposes to improve the services we provide.',
      'Most web browsers automatically accept cookies, but you can usually change your browser settings to display a warning before accepting cookies or to refuse all cookies. If you choose to disable cookies from our website, however, you may be unable to use some features of the site. Visit www.aboutcookies.org to learn how to delete and control cookies on common browsers.',
      'We may use Remarketing with Google Analytics and Facebook for online advertising. Third-party providers, including Google, may display our advertisements on sites across the Internet. We, together with third-party providers including Google, use first-party cookies, such as Google Analytics cookies, and third-party cookies together to inform, optimize and serve advertisements based on a person’s prior visits to our website.',
      'You may opt out of Google Analytics for Display Advertising and customize Google Display Network advertisements through Google’s Ads Settings at https://www.google.com/settings/ads. You may also use Google’s Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on at https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout/.',
