      'You must be at least eighteen (18) years old to access this website. If you are under eighteen, you are not permitted to access this website for any reason. Because of this age restriction, information collected by this website does not fall within the scope of children’s personal data protection rules and is not monitored as such.',
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'Our commitment to data security',
    paragraphs: [
      'The website and systems we operate use security measures intended to protect information within our control from loss, misuse and unauthorized alteration. Although we make every effort to ensure the integrity and security of our network and systems, we cannot guarantee that security measures will prevent third-party hackers from obtaining this information unlawfully.',
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'In the event of a sale or bankruptcy',
    paragraphs: [
      'Ownership of Archway Business Brokers may change at some point in the future. If that happens, we hope this website will continue its relationship with you. In the event of a sale, merger, public offering, bankruptcy or other change of control involving Archway Business Brokers, your information may be shared with the person or business that owns or controls this website, and your choices regarding the use of that information will continue to be respected.',
