  {
    heading: 'Changes to this policy',
    paragraphs: [
      'Archway Business Brokers reserves the right to revise, supplement or amend this policy, the Terms of Use and its other policies at any time and in any manner by updating this posted document. Your continued use of the website after changes are applied means that you acknowledge and accept those changes. Please review this privacy statement before each use to stay informed about changes.',
    ],
